*send* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''send(handle, value)''

Sends a deep copy of a value to an actor's inbox. Non-blocking for the sender.

*Parameters:*
- ''handle'': Actor handle
- ''value'': Any value to send

*Returns:*
- ''ok''

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if handle is not a number
- Runtime error if handle is invalid
